This fixture exercises phpc's deterministic placeholder `mysqli_multi_query()`
charset setup boundary through a WordPress-shaped `wpdb` connection query
method. System PHP needs a real mysqli connection and host multi-result
execution state; phpc only accepts the exact WordPress charset setup statement
as a no-pending-result placeholder and does not model real multi-statement
execution, pending result queues, `mysqli_more_results()`/
`mysqli_next_result()` state, or connection charset mutation.
